麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（微笑）.png","slideTitle":"スライド #27","duration":9.22358276643991,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「どうやら、彼がいた前の学校は、この学園に匹敵するくらいの元男子校で、女子比率は1%未満、問題が山積みのようです。」"},{"title":"シーン 28","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_028_射命丸文.wav","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.028.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%B0%84%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%B8%E6%96%87","voiceDuration":7.520181405895691,"id":"C7959C8C-FE08-40D2-B1D6-31D755C6ED15","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（微笑）.png","slideTitle":"スライド #28","duration":8.120181405895691,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「永琳さんに言われて調べましたが、徹底した閉鎖空間のごくわずかな隙間から入手した情報なので、気をつけてください。」"},{"title":"シーン 29","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_029_射命丸文.wav","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.029.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%B0%84%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%B8%E6%96%87","voiceDuration":3.6015873015873017,"id":"8DFBE84D-E705-4723-B3BC-A86924CD03CC","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（微笑）.png","slideTitle":"スライド #29","duration":4.201587301587302,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「それと、息子さんの言ってたことは全て事実だそうですよ。」"},{"title":"シーン 30","voiceAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_030_永琳.wav","voiceCharacter":"永琳","animationName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.030.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"永琳","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%B0%B8%E7%90%B3","voiceDuration":7.224897959183673,"id":"414AA7D7-C0E3-48FE-B1F8-F05A9C9D5805","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（微笑）.png","slideTitle":"スライド #30","duration":7.837573696145125,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「ありがとう、文。それじゃあ…」私はそう言いながら、棚から札束入りの封筒を取り出し、彼女に渡す。"},{"title":"シーン 31","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_031_射命丸文.wav","voiceCharacter":"射命丸文","animationName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.031.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"射命丸文","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%B0%84%E5%91%BD%E4%B8%B8%E6%96%87","voiceDuration":4.105578231292517,"id":"2DEC7B3B-35A3-464C-A0DC-37AEB22BC459","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/文（余裕）.png","slideTitle":"スライド #31","duration":4.705578231292517,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「代金、確かにいただきました。それでは、またのご利用を。」"},{"title":"シーン 32","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_032_永琳.wav","voiceCharacter":"永琳","animationName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.032.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"永琳","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%B0%B8%E7%90%B3","voiceDuration":6.213832199546485,"id":"2230F927-1EF6-474C-A6C7-1657D4956DBA","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"スライド #32","duration":6.813832199546485,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"彼女はそういうと、診察室から出ていった。\n「もうすこし、早く気づいてあげればよかったのかしら…」"},{"title":"シーン 33","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_033_永琳.wav","voiceCharacter":"永琳","animationName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.033.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","characterName":"永琳","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%B0%B8%E7%90%B3","voiceDuration":7.329614512471656,"id":"A7C65139-D5A2-46AE-BF13-0328BAB71000","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"スライド #33","duration":7.929614512471655,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"私はそう言いながら、息子が、しんどそうな、顔で私に、彼の診察を依頼してきた日のことを思い出していた。"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","id":"5BA4849D-4A8F-4504-960F-8D74A7707798","slideTitle":"スライド #34","duration":3.5,"characterName":"ナレーション","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.034.jpeg","title":"シーン 34","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","animationName":"なし","telop":"彼に視点が戻り…"},{"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_035_操夢.wav","voiceDuration":9.489773242630385,"title":"シーン 35","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.035.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","id":"0ABC7DD8-702D-489E-A53C-A2D5E149D4BF","telop":"僕の心が声にもならず、自分自身で気づくこともできず、疲弊貯金が始まったのは、今考ると、最初の内部進学をしてからだった…","slideTitle":"スライド #35","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":10.089773242630384,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu"},{"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_036_操夢.wav","voiceDuration":8.366938775510205,"title":"シーン 36","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.036.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","id":"E5416AF0-C37C-479B-93D3-93452390778B","telop":"だんだんと、周りと自分との差が開き始め、友達もできなかった僕は、その空間で目立ち、教室の隅に染まっていた。","slideTitle":"スライド #36","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":8.966938775510204,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu"},{"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_037_操夢.wav","voiceDuration":8.261519274376417,"title":"シーン 37","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.037.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","id":"1D7DCF61-9875-4C35-829D-E443CFCD9925","telop":"だが、小学生の頃は、勉強を常にしてれば、なんとなく開いた差が埋まるのか、勉強にどんどんと専念するようになった。","slideTitle":"スライド #37","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":8.861519274376416,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu"},{"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_038_操夢.wav","voiceDuration":8.697369614512471,"title":"シーン 38","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.038.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","id":"8099BFE8-67E4-4C34-8876-15C79677550A","telop":"一般的に、勉強を嫌う人もいるが、なんだかんだで大人たちは勉強を否定することはない。なぜなら、将来に関わるからだ。","slideTitle":"スライド #38","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":9.297369614512471,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu"},{"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_039_操夢.wav","voiceDuration":8.525646258503402,"title":"シーン 39","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.039.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","id":"E05BE6F5-49B7-4E4E-98F6-B73AB186CCD0","telop":"だが、僕の場合は、その学校の空気を避けるための口実に、勉強をしていた。だが、それでも勉強の成果は出ていた。","slideTitle":"スライド #39","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":9.125646258503401,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu"},{"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_040_操夢.wav","voiceDuration":7.856077097505669,"title":"シーン 40","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.040.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","id":"8C82962E-CDCD-4663-BABA-CE3D59171098","telop":"そして、時が進むにつれて、なんらかの負担が僕にのしかかり、根幹的な僕の何かが崩れるような感覚を感じた。","slideTitle":"スライド #40","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":8.45607709750567,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu"},{"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_041_操夢.wav","voiceDuration":6.240861678004535,"title":"シーン 41","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.041.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","id":"46D6A17B-421B-4328-8511-903EFB10BAD8","telop":"そのまま僕は、2回目の内部進学を済ませ、\nいざ中学生になると、状況は一変する。","slideTitle":"スライド #41","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":6.840861678004535,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","telop":"そして”それ”は、僕に強い衝撃をもたらし、小学生の頃は時折、少し感じる程度だった、その変化が急速に進んでいった。","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"スライド #42","voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 42","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_042_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.803900226757369,"id":"286A26F1-EB3A-4B0C-9E0F-FDE084EAE892","duration":9.403900226757369,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.042.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","telop":"僕は、それを今でも覚えている。いや、正確に言えば、僕の心に打撃を与えたその傷跡が、僕を束縛しているのだ…","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"スライド #43","voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 43","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_043_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","voiceDuration":8.601723356009071,"id":"4ADFE473-4006-43EC-B914-13CF7AA0AC3F","duration":9.20172335600907,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.043.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","telop":"そう、それは…","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"スライド #44","voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 44","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","voiceDuration":1.5,"id":"E935CD2E-0871-469D-8A1E-E9A658FA2296","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.044.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg"},{"backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","transitionName":"なし","telop":"「よかったわ、目が覚めたようで。」","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","slideTitle":"スライド #45","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","title":"シーン 45","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_045_博麗霊夢.wav","animationName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.481995464852608,"id":"6FD8AD2B-5318-4797-805D-AF196DA9EBD0","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.045.jpeg","characterName":"博麗霊夢"},{"backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","transitionName":"なし","telop":"「母さん…」\n僕は、そう彼女に返す。","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","slideTitle":"スライド #46","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","title":"シーン 46","voiceAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_046_博麗霊夢.wav","animationName":"なし","voiceDuration":2.7712925170068026,"id":"4E4976EE-DE54-4233-B244-5414D8AE67A9","duration":3.786984126984127,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.046.jpeg","characterName":"博麗霊夢"},{"backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","transitionName":"なし","telop":"「あんたが、呻いてるから、私が何度も声かけたのよ…、\n私に心配かけさせないでちょうだい…」","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","slideTitle":"スライド #47","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","title":"シーン 47","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_047_博麗霊夢.wav","animationName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.301995464852608,"id":"7D904409-C097-4ABB-8B96-3E33C3B525AE","duration":7.901995464852607,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.047.jpeg","characterName":"博麗霊夢"},{"backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","transitionName":"なし","telop":"「ご…ごめんなさい…」","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","slideTitle":"スライド #48","voiceCharacter":"操夢","title":"シーン 48","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_048_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","voiceDuration":1.5,"id":"831347FC-FAAE-4405-9A69-E565F5DDDAAF","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.048.jpeg","characterName":"操夢"},{"backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","transitionName":"なし","telop":"「いいわよ、謝らなくて、とりあえず、\n今晩はゆっくりと寝て、疲労回復に努めなさいね…」","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","slideTitle":"スライド #49","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","title":"シーン 49","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_049_博麗霊夢.wav","animationName":"なし","voiceDuration":7.1394784580498865,"id":"45C55C49-095D-466C-80D5-2DC61C06085A","duration":7.739478458049886,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.049.jpeg","characterName":"博麗霊夢"},{"duration":4.354489795918367,"telop":"「これから私は家に帰るから、しっかりするのよ…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.050.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","id":"6560E025-C9A8-49CF-A2EF-AC89D87C1C63","slideTitle":"スライド #50","voiceDuration":3.754489795918367,"title":"シーン 50","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_050_博麗霊夢.wav","transitionName":"なし"},{"duration":9.50281179138322,"telop":"彼女は、そういうと、涙を拭いながら、病室を出ていった。\n僕は、先ほどの悪夢で疲れ込んだのか、そのまま眠りに落ちた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.051.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc256899_病室-夜-電気あり.png","characterName":"操夢","animationName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","id":"8283B199-1E8D-4104-983A-B6B67D5A2689","slideTitle":"スライド #51","voiceDuration":8.90281179138322,"title":"シーン 51","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_051_操夢.wav","transitionName":"なし"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"ED468F88-0AEE-4004-8DE7-79E39CC2EFBF","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.052.jpeg","telop":"霊夢が家に帰ると…","animationName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","slideTitle":"スライド #52","title":"シーン 52"},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":4.631995464852607,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.053.jpeg","telop":"私が家に帰ってくると、すでに夫がリビングにいた。","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","id":"AF4ABA44-968F-47E7-ACAA-C3725B432E66","slideTitle":"スライド #53","voiceDuration":4.031995464852607,"title":"シーン 53","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_053_博麗霊夢.wav","transitionName":"なし"},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":6.843333333333333,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.054.jpeg","telop":"「霊夢、お前その顔どうした？」\n私は、彼女が泣いた後の表情をしていたのでそう問いかける。","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"妹紅","animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"妹紅","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%A6%B9%E7%B4%85","id":"2D1472FC-1106-4B95-8DE5-B65C32C04938","slideTitle":"スライド #54","voiceDuration":6.243333333333333,"title":"シーン 54","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_054_妹紅.wav","transitionName":"なし"},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":4.964489795918367,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.055.jpeg","telop":"「そんなことどうだっていいわ、それより、夕飯は食べたの？」","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","id":"956EB0B4-4C52-40FB-A89E-CCCB315A90FF","slideTitle":"スライド #55","voiceDuration":4.3644897959183675,"title":"シーン 55","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_055_博麗霊夢.wav","transitionName":"なし"},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":3.86,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.056.jpeg","telop":"「夕飯ならもう食べたぞ、湯船は冷めちまってるが…」","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"妹紅","animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"妹紅","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%A6%B9%E7%B4%85","id":"D6C3FA10-DAC3-4538-B396-F6153F473624","slideTitle":"スライド #56","voiceDuration":3.26,"title":"シーン 56","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_056_妹紅.wav","transitionName":"なし"},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":7.335736961451246,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.057.jpeg","telop":"「そう、じゃあとりあえず、お風呂入ってくるわ…」\n私はそういうと、そのまま風呂に向かった。","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","id":"BF134A0B-4B24-4390-8E0B-7406FEBAD78C","slideTitle":"スライド #57","voiceDuration":6.735736961451247,"title":"シーン 57","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_057_博麗霊夢.wav","transitionName":"なし"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"9D0BBCAA-4221-4441-A3B7-C1B5B945839B","duration":3.5,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.058.jpeg","telop":"霊夢がお風呂を澄ますと…","animationName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","slideTitle":"スライド #58","title":"シーン 58"},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":9.024489795918367,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.059.jpeg","telop":"私がお風呂から戻ってくると、彼はビール缶をあけ、ため息をついていた。「何か現場仕事に不満でもあるの？」","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","id":"2877EC51-11A6-4EB2-80F2-5E90A4A3FF84","slideTitle":"スライド #59","voiceDuration":8.424489795918367,"title":"シーン 59","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_059_博麗霊夢.wav","transitionName":"なし"},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":3.905827664399093,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.060.jpeg","telop":"「今日は、例の紅魔建設からの依頼だったんだけど…」","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"妹紅","animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"妹紅","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%A6%B9%E7%B4%85","id":"5963F13D-6FB3-4048-9BDB-DAA802A55EF8","slideTitle":"スライド #60","voiceDuration":3.305827664399093,"title":"シーン 60","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_060_妹紅.wav","transitionName":"なし"},{"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":12.114739229024943,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.061.jpeg","telop":"彼はそういうと、その話を始める。特殊な力で一瞬で建造物を破壊できる女性がいる一族経営の館の解体工事中の出来事だった。","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","id":"C670EE94-62FB-4FA5-9F40-1149E5BB2BBD","slideTitle":"スライド #61","voiceDuration":11.679727891156462,"title":"シーン 61","voiceAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_061_博麗霊夢.wav","transitionName":"なし"},{"slideTitle":"スライド #62","duration":7.974580498866213,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%A6%B9%E7%B4%85","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"妹紅","title":"シーン 62","voiceAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_062_妹紅.wav","id":"E524B053-C1BA-4F64-99CA-94662BC92EEC","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.062.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.5245804988662135,"animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"妹紅","telop":"「その館は、３階建だったんだけど、その金髪女性の一言で崩壊すると、その断片が俺に飛んできてさ…」"},{"slideTitle":"スライド #63","duration":7.396439909297052,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%A6%B9%E7%B4%85","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"妹紅","title":"シーン 63","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_063_妹紅.wav","id":"51745113-2128-4CA4-9733-913B2A6CE424","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.063.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.796439909297052,"animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"妹紅","telop":"「その断片を直前に避けてから、そいつに言ってやったんだ、「こんなリスキーなことしてたら労災につながるぞって。」"},{"slideTitle":"スライド #64","duration":7.626666666666666,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%A6%B9%E7%B4%85","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"妹紅","title":"シーン 64","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_064_妹紅.wav","id":"226DD09D-C06D-4C45-A57F-B5C4BF263732","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.064.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.026666666666666,"animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"妹紅","telop":"「だけどそいつの姉がまぁ、お嬢様気取りの嫌なやつで、俺の助言など耳にも入れない、昔からあそこはそうだ…」"},{"slideTitle":"スライド #65","duration":8.468321995464853,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%A6%B9%E7%B4%85","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"妹紅","title":"シーン 65","voiceAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_065_妹紅.wav","id":"F5D896F1-F4C9-42E8-9C95-2708004DDF72","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.065.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.964149659863946,"animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"妹紅","telop":"「だが、そんなことよりも、今日もこうして、霊夢のところに帰って来れて、俺は幸せ者だぜ。」私はそう笑みを浮かべる。"},{"slideTitle":"スライド #66","duration":9.841995464852607,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","characterName":"博麗霊夢","title":"シーン 66","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_066_博麗霊夢.wav","id":"2CFAC047-2DC9-464F-8843-E5697D387BE8","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981\/元女子校の日常　第3話_c997bea981.066.jpeg","voiceDuration":9.241995464852607,"animationName":"なし","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「そうね…」私は、夫のその発言こう返すことしかできなかった。そして、なんだか距離を感じてしまったのだった。"},{"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","animationDuration":2,"animationNote":"表示時間：2秒","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","id":"823AE002-3F19-4EAF-8CC9-767ADD312FB4","duration":2,"telop":"続く","animationName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","slideTitle":"スライド #67","title":"シーン 67"},{"backgroundName":"単色背景","transitionName":"なし","seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/BGM\/nc122879_【東方アレンジ】砕月～いぶきすいかのものがたり～.wav","id":"0A202A01-DB2A-4CCC-A3DF-A30AF815A233","duration":20,"telop":"ご視聴ありがとうございました！","animationName":"なし","characterName":"博麗霊夢","seName":"SE: nc122879_【東方アレンジ】砕月～いぶきすいかのものがたり～","slideTitle":"スライド #68","title":"シーン 68: ご視聴ありがとうございました！"}]